Package: devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-asyncflip
Version: 1.0-1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Recommends: xlibre
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Async flips on secondary outputs for modesetting and amdgpu
 X11 OutputClass section that enables AsyncFlipSecondaries in the
 modesetting driver of XLibre or the amdgpu DDX (default: off). With
 DRI3 page flipping on a multi-display screen only one display is
 synchronized to vblank; with this option the other displays flip
 asynchronously and may tear. Mainly useful when the displays mirror or
 clone each other.
